{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.poster.avif?t=1764892176\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.webm?t=1764892176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.mp4?t=1764892176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to 10 players (5v5) as  Hunters and Mimics will battle it out in hilariously sneaky and strategic first/third person gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will swap between the Hunters and Mimics as they constantly trying to best the other team in a modern take on Prop Hunt style gameplay. Both sides have an arsenal of abilities to unlock and use to their advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones are highly recommended, as sound is one of the most important ways to detect the dreaded Mimics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hunters (First Person)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of Hunters summoned from across the galaxy; they will stop at nothing to destroy the Mimic Man's essence once and for all. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by eliminating all enemy team Mimics before time runs out. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely - the vociferating cry of a Mimic will reveal its location. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and use 26 different Hunter Gear with various advantages. Choose abilities that fit your playstyle and support your team!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mimics (Third Person)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created from the Mimic Man's essence, The Mimics will do anything they can to survive and continue to spread chaos throughout the universe.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by having at least one Mimic survive until time runs out or by killing all the Hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on the move or hide when necessary -- Hunters will desperately try to eliminate you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and use 26 different Mimic Evolutions with various advantages. Choose abilities that fit your playstyle and support your team!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization: Player models, hats, abilities, vociferations, victory poses, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two primary Gameplay Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compulsive Vociferation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimics are forced to vociferate automatically against their will.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Decay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimics must vociferate willingly or die. </p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer physics replication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock a total of 52 different abilities split between Hunters and Mimics! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Post-Release</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear and Evolution specialization skill tree</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned skill points to specialize your Hunter or Mimic abilities even further!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Gear and Evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More hats, Hunters, and Mimic Variants!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/802160?t=1764892176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/802160?t=1764892176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/d5eec9751e0909e35e01b268a3dba3afb1ee48a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764892176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/d5eec9751e0909e35e01b268a3dba3afb1ee48a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764892176","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.poster.avif?t=1764892176\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.webm?t=1764892176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/extras/5869ab18b292eb455fb9c614d158dfb6.mp4?t=1764892176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to 10 players (5v5) as  Hunters and Mimics will battle it out in hilariously sneaky and strategic first/third person gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will swap between the Hunters and Mimics as they constantly trying to best the other team in a modern take on Prop Hunt style gameplay. Both sides have an arsenal of abilities to unlock and use to their advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones are highly recommended, as sound is one of the most important ways to detect the dreaded Mimics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hunters (First Person)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of Hunters summoned from across the galaxy; they will stop at nothing to destroy the Mimic Man's essence once and for all. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by eliminating all enemy team Mimics before time runs out. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely - the vociferating cry of a Mimic will reveal its location. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and use 26 different Hunter Gear with various advantages. Choose abilities that fit your playstyle and support your team!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mimics (Third Person)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created from the Mimic Man's essence, The Mimics will do anything they can to survive and continue to spread chaos throughout the universe.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by having at least one Mimic survive until time runs out or by killing all the Hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on the move or hide when necessary -- Hunters will desperately try to eliminate you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and use 26 different Mimic Evolutions with various advantages. Choose abilities that fit your playstyle and support your team!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization: Player models, hats, abilities, vociferations, victory poses, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two primary Gameplay Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compulsive Vociferation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimics are forced to vociferate automatically against their will.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Decay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimics must vociferate willingly or die. </p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer physics replication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock a total of 52 different abilities split between Hunters and Mimics! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Post-Release</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear and Evolution specialization skill tree</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned skill points to specialize your Hunter or Mimic abilities even further!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Gear and Evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More hats, Hunters, and Mimic Variants!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Silent Krill, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/802160/fc2fccc16d696c84c542f5c80fb8d733a8364e63/header.jpg?t=1764892176","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/802160/1842356363/361ad7316cec4597d36d9aa4a3391b91fe8c80d1/1763996395/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763999345","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/802160/1842356363/361ad7316cec4597d36d9aa4a3391b91fe8c80d1/1763996395/dash_h264.mpd?